        {
          "es": "Le pidió que fuera a Girah a pedir la mano de Ratna Manggali.",
          "en": "He asked him to go to Girah and ask for Ratna Manggali's hand in marriage."
        },
        {
          "es": "Bahula era listo y amable, y sabía que esta no era una tarea cualquiera.",
          "en": "Bahula was clever and gentle, and he knew this was no ordinary task."
        },
        {
          "es": "Bahula se inclinó ante su maestro y se puso en camino.",
          "en": "Bahula bowed to his teacher, and set out on the road."
        }
