        },
        {
          "es": "Ratna Manggali le contó de un libro de hojas de palma que su madre leía cada noche.",
          "en": "Ratna Manggali told him about a book of palm leaves that her mother read every night."
        },
        {
          "es": "Nunca se separa de él, dijo. Solo lo deja cuando duerme.",
          "en": "It never leaves her side, she said. Only when she sleeps does she put it down."
        }
